      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استخلفهُ</span></b> : see 2, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>He
took it</i> (a thing) <i>as a substitute,</i> or <i>in exchange,
for another thing;</i> or <i>in the place of another
thing;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَعْوَضَهُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَبْدَلَهُ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استخلفتِ الأَرْضُ</span> <i>The land produced the herbage of
the</i> [<i>season called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَبْدَلَهُ</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also 1, in
the middle of the latter half of the paragraph, in
two places.

